  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Given**\n\n(x + 25)% of 270 is 20% more than x% of 240\n\n**Calculation**\n\n(x + 25)% of 270 = x% of 240 + 20% of x% of 240\n\n(x + 25)% × 270 = 240x/100 + 48x/100\n\n⇒ 270(x + 25)over 100 = 240xover100+ 48xover100\n\n⇒ 270(x + 25)over100 = 288xover100\n\n⇒ 270x + 6750 = 288x\n\n⇒ 6750 = 18x\n\n⇒ x = 375\n\n12% of (x + 125)\n\n⇒ 12% of (375 + 125)\n\n⇒ 12% of 500\n\n⇒ 60\n\n10% of x\n\n⇒ 10% of 375\n\n⇒ 37.5\n\nRequired percentage = (60 - 37.5)over 37.5 × 100\n\n22.5over37.5× 100\n\n⇒ 60\n\n**∴ 12% of (x + 125) is 60% more than 10% of x.**",
